  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ch 401.04 “National Board of Chiropractic Examiners (NBCE)” means a nonprofit organization which designs and administers examinations including written and practice components testing proficiency in chiropractic.\n\nSource. #5624, eff 5-18-93, EXPIRED: 5-18-99\n\nNew. #8739, eff 10-11-06, EXPIRED: 10-11-14\n\nNew. #12107, INTERIM, eff 2-21-17, EXPIRED: 8-20-17\n\nNew. #12431, eff 12-8-17",
